Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.29,0:22:27.32,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}Everything melts into the dead of night
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.32,0:22:32.57,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.32,0:22:38.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.82,0:22:43.35,ED - JP,,0,118,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「寂しい」忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.62,0:22:51.68,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1100)\blur5\t(4951,0,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.44,0:22:54.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\t(0,300,\3c&H000000&)}Dance with me？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.28,0:22:58.44,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}二人で無限の闇を
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.44,0:23:03.61,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}重ねた　手のひら　ぎゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.27,0:23:09.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.43,0:23:16.08,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1068)\blur5}悲しいくらいに　美しいんだね
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.08,0:23:20.87,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.34,0:23:25.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.32,0:23:37.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}Stay in night
Dialogue: 6,0:22:21.29,0:22:27.32,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}万物消融于深夜的寂静
Dialogue: 6,0:22:27.32,0:22:32.57,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}仿佛连重力也逐渐消失
Dialogue: 6,0:22:33.32,0:22:38.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}被你火花般的笑容迷住
Dialogue: 6,0:22:38.82,0:22:43.35,ED - CN,,120,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}今夜让人忘却何为「寂寞」
Dialogue: 6,0:22:45.62,0:22:51.68,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1100)\blur5\t(4951,0,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}给我讲些无聊却令人眷恋的事吧
Dialogue: 6,0:22:52.44,0:22:54.28,ED - CN,,123,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\3c&H868686&\t(0,300,\3c&H000000&)}愿意与我共舞吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:22:54.28,0:22:58.44,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}两个人　在无尽的黑暗中
Dialogue: 6,0:22:58.44,0:23:03.61,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}掌心相叠　紧紧相握
Dialogue: 6,0:23:04.27,0:23:09.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}模糊的视野中映出的景象
Dialogue: 6,0:23:10.43,0:23:16.08,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1068)\blur5}竟是那般令人悲伤的美丽
Dialogue: 6,0:23:16.08,0:23:20.87,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}远方渐渐破晓的天空
Dialogue: 6,0:23:21.34,0:23:25.38,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}我却别开了目光
Dialogue: 6,0:23:31.32,0:23:37.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}留在这夜色中
